# Reviewed and accepted for this demo project. Reasons are in docs/DECISIONS.md.

# S3 buckets use AES256 (SSE-S3). A customer managed KMS key costs extra and needs extra CloudFront key policy.
AWS-0132

# SNS topic is unencrypted. CloudWatch alarms cannot publish to a topic that uses the AWS managed key.
AWS-0095

# No WAF in front of CloudFront. WAF is a paid service and is listed as a known gap.
AWS-0011